      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i've been seeing some stuff in older study guides about how different groups respond differently to meds and even how they perceive pain, which seems wild but i know it's in the literature. does that kind of thing apply to general clinical assessments? like, are there specific racial groups that are known to be more resilient to pain or have different baseline physiological needs in an ER setting?",
